# No embedded playback (law)

Read skill **forja-live-native-playback** when touching live resolve, unlock, Providers, or “fix dead stream”.

**Law:** Forja Live / live-sports → **native player** with a real play URL, or **nothing**. No embed / WebView fallback.

| Do not | |
|--------|--|
| `webviewOnly` / embedUrl-only / iframe as “streams” | |
| Open embed WebView for Forja Live | |
| Show embed URLs in Sources without resolved `url` | |
| Changelog that treats embed fallback as a fix | |

Resolve miss → toast “no playable stream”. Unlock fail → **omit** the row. Improve unlock or skip — never ship WebView as workaround without asking ([honesty](./honesty-and-completion.mdc) · [no-hide-as-fix](./no-hide-as-fix.mdc)).

Catalog schedule-only → [live-catalog-schedule-only.mdc](./live-catalog-schedule-only.mdc) (same skill).
